{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/26/5683031/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/26/5683031/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のメンバーちゃん達\nみんな所々面白かったの\\( ˆ ˆ )/笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのノートに書いてある\n沢山の動物の絵について説明してもらったり\nまあやが自分の名前の字の練習をしていたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織とみり愛に何故か「まま〜！きゃははは」と\n言われて私の周りを走り回られたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未とちまが別のアイドルグループの\n女の子達になりきって自己紹介していたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未が急に歌い出して、どれだけの人から\n注目を集められるかゲームを1人でしていたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢音ちゃんが急に私の下っ腹をグーで押してきて\n何！？って言ったら、昔よくこうやって鍛えてたんです。\nって教えてくれたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然意味わからない事だらけだけど笑\nとても楽しいメンバー達です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"賑やかで暖かくて楽しいよ〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/26/5683031/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日物凄くテンションが高くって\n騒いでた伊織。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/26/5683031/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノートの最初には必ず、何故か風船を持ってる\nうさぎちゃんを書くことを決めているまあや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うさぎちゃんを書かないと始まらないみたい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Wake up!」AAAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲を聴くと夏の暑さを思い出すくらいに\n元気になれるし明るくて素敵な曲。\n皆さんの声質も声も大好きだし\nハモリもカッコいいし本当いい。\n\"好奇心に任せて 想いのまま\n目指す所へ それがAdventure\"\n目指す所へ向かうこと。\n冒険心を忘れずに前へ前へ。\nキャッチーで覚えやすいし歌いたくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/26/5683031/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テストもいよいよ佳境に入ります...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}